('0040167bc01707c5e5', 'shipping from amazon', 'services', 'Shipping Services', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'other', 2, 'laptop', '{\"estimated time\":\"3 days \",\"max weight\":\"4kg\",\"products available for this service\":\"all electronic devices\"}', '[\"986f8b68df9c6c2368.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"boxed\",\"price\":60000,\"newprice\":60000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:16'),
('0087da1283da170cd6', 'Samsung Galaxy S9 (4GB RAM, 256GB Storage)', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'samsung', 'galaxy s', 'other', 1000, 'The Samsung Galaxy S9 is a flagship smartphone that features a 5.8-inch Super AMOLED display with a resolution of 2960 x 1440 pixels. The phone is powered by an octa-core processor and 4GB of RAM, making it powerful and efficient.\n\nThe Galaxy S9 comes with 64GB of internal storage, which can be expanded up to 400GB via a microSD card. The phone features a 12MP rear camera with dual-aperture and a 8MP front-facing camera, making it perfect for capturing great photos and videos.\n\nOther features of', '{\"display\":\"5.8-inch Super AMOLED display with 2960 x 1440 pixels resolution\",\"CPU\":\"Qualcomm Snapdragon 845 octa-core processor\",\"RAM\":\"4GB\",\"storage\":\"256GB\",\"main camera\":\"12MP with dual-aperture (f/1.5 and f/2.4) and OIS\",\"selfie camera\":\"8MP with autofocus\",\"battery\":\"Non-removable 3000mAh battery with fast charging and wireless charging\",\"connectivity\":\"4G LTE, Wi-Fi 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac, Bluetooth 5.0, NFC, GPS, USB Type-C\",\"sensors\":\"Fingerprint scanner, facial recognition, iris scanner, accelerometer, gyro, proximity, compass, barometer, heart rate, SpO2\"}', '[\"9493d3cc56d5800526.png\",\"f550e51e38ee296814.png\",\"ed0c3101cfe90e8973.png\",\"dc90c15a9284c01b55.png\",\"3c26da33b58ad0237f.png\",\"49574025d968b230c8.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":300000,\"newprice\":300000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('07c75122db145eef67', '45W Type C USB AC Charger for HP Chromebook 11 11A G6 G7 G8 EE; Chromebook 14 14A G5 14-ca051wm 14-ca052wm 14-ca091wm 14-db0050nr 14-ca061dx Laptop ', 'accessories', 'laptop accessories', 'hp', 'HP cables', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 1000, 'it is compatible with the HP Chromebook 11 11A G6 G7 G8 EE, Chromebook 14 14A G5 14-ca051wm 14-ca052wm 14-ca091wm 14-db0050nr 14-ca061dx laptops.\n\nWith a Type C USB connector, this charger is easy to plug in and provides fast and efficient charging. It is designed to work with 100-240V AC power inputs, making it perfect for use anywhere in the world.\n\nThis power supply cord is built with high-quality materials and includes multiple safety features to protect against overvoltage, overcurrent, and', '{\"input \":\"100V-240V\",\"Compatibility\":\"Compatible with a range of HP laptops\",\"connector type\":\"USB Type-c (USB-C)\",\"compatibility\":\"Compatible with HP Chromebook 11 11A G6 G7 G8 EE, Chromebook 14 14A G5, 14-ca051wm, 14-ca052wm, 14-ca091wm, 14-db0050nr, 14-ca061dx and other laptops that require a Type-C USB power adapter.\",\"output\":\"5V 3A / 9V 3A / 12V 3A / 15V 3A / 20V 2.25A Power: 45W\",\"protection\":\"Over-current, over-voltage, short-circuit and over-temperature protection\"}', '[\"3666a28dfeda35cc9e.png\",\"380159a299a899ed75.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":30000,\"newprice\":30000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{\"method\":\"air\"}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:34:48'),
('07cc8f4653ef740c0c', 'OnePlus 5T A5010 64GB Dual-SIM (GSM Only, No CDMA) Factory Unlocked 4G/LTE Smartphone (Midnight Black) - International', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'oneplus', 'onePlus T series', 'gaming', 3000, 'A New View. Optimized for low-light and portrait photography. Our highly rated 16 + 20 MP cameras help you capture crystal-clear shots. Leap into a truly immersive flagship experience. Our Full Optic AMOLED 18:9 display complements the masterfully crafted all-aluminum body for a sleek, yet resilient design. The best of Android refined. OxygenOS is streamlined with feedback from our users for a refreshing user experience. Your experience with Qualcomm Snapdragon 835 optimized, thanks to a seamles', '{\"Battery\":\"Li-Po 3300 mAh, non-removable\",\"Storage\":\"64GB\",\"RAM\":\"4GB\",\"CPU\":\"Octa-core (4x2.45 GHz Kryo & 4x1.9 GHz Kryo)\",\"main camera\":\"dual 16MP,20MP\",\"Selfie camera\":\"single 16MP\"}', '[\"d24f43674a5e3d6c23.jpeg\",\"a4bbb9d3f5ee80ebf4.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":138800,\"newprice\":138800,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('0813ef12f1942a3718', 'OnePlus 7T HD1907, 4G LTE, US Version, 128GB, Frosted Silver - GSM Unlocked for T-Mobile', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'oneplus', 'onePlus T series', 'gaming', 2997, 'With a responsive 90 Hz refresh rate and the latest HDR10+ technology, the OnePlus 7T’s Fluid Display is smooth, vivid, and incredibly immersive. If it sounds too good to wait until you see it. Every experience feels more seamless in stunning 90 Hz. It doesn’t just look smoother - it feels smoother, too. 6. 55 inch display - Games are more captivating, videos are more cinematic, and everyday tasks are easier in a aspect ratio. Certified by world-renowned TÜV Rheinland for light reduction and vie', '{\"main camera\":\"tripple 48MP, 12MP, 12MP\",\"selfie camera\":\"single 12MP\",\"CPU\":\"Octa-core (1x2.96 GHz Kryo 485 & 3x2.42 GHz Kryo 485 & 4x1.78 GHz Kryo 485)\",\"battery\":\"Li-Po 3800 mAh, non-removable\",\"RAM\":\"8GB\",\"storage\":\"128GB\"}', '[\"0e6541bc17f8151242.jpeg\",\"902e55e33a5525b79b.jpeg\",\"cc31d7284982c7730b.jpeg\",\"6c26c8b21f3d895de9.jpeg\",\"ab61389cd3c7ee9f1f.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":277600,\"newprice\":277600,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 3, '{}', 'active', '2024-03-06 22:57:10'),
('0c731d06b6a2f184f9', 'Samsung Galaxy S8, 64GB, 4GB', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'samsung', 'galaxy s', 'other', 100, 'The Samsung Galaxy S8 is a flagship smartphone that boasts a beautiful 5.8-inch Super AMOLED display with a resolution of 2960 x 1440 pixels. The phone is powered by an octa-core processor and 4GB of RAM, making it snappy and responsive.\n\nThe Galaxy S8 comes with 64GB of internal storage, which can be expanded up to 256GB via a microSD card. The phone features a 12MP rear camera with dual-pixel autofocus and an 8MP front-facing camera with autofocus, making it perfect for capturing great photos ', '{\"main camera\":\"12MP with dual-pixel autofocus and LED flash\",\"selfie camera\":\"8MP with autofocus\",\"RAM\":\"4GB\",\"Storage\":\"64GB\",\"battery\":\"Non-removable 3000mAh battery with fast charging and wireless charging\",\"connectivity\":\"4G LTE, Wi-Fi 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac, Bluetooth 5.0, NFC, GPS, USB Type-C\",\"display\":\"5.8-inch Super AMOLED display with 2960 x 1440 pixels resolution\",\"sensors\":\"Fingerprint scanner, facial recognition, iris scanner, accelerometer, gyro, \",\"CPU\":\"Qualcomm Snapdragon 835 octa-core processor\"}', '[\"2c001061e46918fa7f.jpeg\",\"da07e53a02df1628c2.jpeg\",\"ebc9255c935f362dfe.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":240000,\"newprice\":240000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('0e6cccdfd6a00a1f2d', 'desktop gaming fan', 'accessories', 'desktop accessories', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 20, 'When discussing gaming fans in terms of hardware, it often refers to cooling fans used in gaming systems. Gaming PCs, laptops, and gaming consoles typically incorporate specialized cooling solutions, including fans, to dissipate heat generated by high-performance components during intense gaming sessions. These fans help maintain optimal temperatures and prevent overheating, ensuring the hardware operates efficiently.', '{\"Size\":\"    Case fans come in various sizes, such as 120mm and 140mm. The size affects the airflow and noise levels.\",\"Speed (RPM - Revolutions Per Minute)\":\"Measured in RPM, the speed of the fan determines how fast it rotates. Higher RPM generally results in more airflow but can also lead to increased noise.\",\"Static Pressure\":\"    Particularly important for fans used on radiators or heat sinks. It measures the force the fan can exert to push air through restricted spaces.\",\"Bearing Type\":\"    Common bearing types include sleeve, ball, and fluid dynamic bearings, each with its characteristics in terms of noise and durability.\",\"Speed (RPM)\":\"The rotation speed affects the cooling efficiency.\",\"Airflow (CFM)\":\"    Indicates the volume of air the fan can move, influencing the cooling capability.\"}', '[\"1c76b6f28b272054cd.jpeg\",\"4a0720b3e20d93cefa.jpeg\",\"247ce46cf01b02642d.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":11000,\"newprice\":11000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{\"delivery duration\":\"3 days\"}', 'active', '2024-01-22 09:39:38'),
('0f4d700c1179fc401e', 'SAMSUNG Galaxy A51 A515F 128GB DUOS GSM Unlocked Phone w/Quad Camera 48 MP + 12 MP + 5 MP + 5 MP (Compatible LTE)', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'samsung', 'Galaxy A', 'other', 100, 'The Samsung Galaxy A51 is a mid-range smartphone that features a 6.5-inch Super AMOLED display with a resolution of 2400 x 1080 pixels. The phone is powered by an octa-core processor and 4GB/6GB/8GB of RAM, making it fast and efficient.\n\nThe Galaxy A51 comes with 64GB/128GB of internal storage, which can be expanded up to 1TB via a microSD card. The phone features a quad-camera setup on the rear, including a 48MP primary camera, a 12MP ultrawide camera, a 5MP macro camera, and a 5MP depth sensor', '{\"main camera\":\"Quad-camera setup with 48MP primary camera, 12MP ultrawide camera, 5MP macro camera, and 5MP depth sensor\",\"selfie camera\":\"32MP with f/2.2 aperture\",\"RAM\":\"6GB\",\"Storage\":\"128GB\",\"display\":\"6.5-inch Super AMOLED display with 2400 x 1080 pixels resolution\",\"battery\":\" Non-removable 4000mAh battery with fast charging support\",\"CPU\":\"Exynos 9611 octa-core processor\",\"sensors\":\"In-display fingerprint sensor, accelerometer, gyro, proximity, compass\",\"connectivity\":\"4G LTE, Wi-Fi 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac, Bluetooth 5.0, NFC, GPS, USB Type-C\"}', '[\"cb5e3065dd52e20b56.jpeg\",\"36caf954bf918edf29.jpeg\",\"433d90642a5c91f3a5.jpeg\",\"71a20bc98be5fc0b5f.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":280000,\"newprice\":280000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('1642db7418fb14e82e', 'Sony Xperia X unlocked smartphone 32GB,3GB', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'Sony', 'Xperia', 'other', 1000, 'The Sony Xperia X is a sleek and stylish unlocked smartphone that features a 5.0-inch Full HD display, offering a vibrant and clear visual experience. It runs on Android 6.0 Marshmallow, which can be upgraded to Android 8.0 Oreo, and is powered by a Snapdragon 650 hexa-core processor, providing fast and smooth performance.\n\nThe Xperia X comes with 32GB of internal storage, which can be expanded up to 256GB via a microSD card, giving you plenty of space to store all your files and media. It has a', '{\"main camera\":\"23MP with 1/2.3 in Exmor RS sensor, predictive hybrid autofocus, and LED flash\",\"selfie camera\":\"13MP with wide-angle lens\",\"battery\":\"Non-removable 2620mAh battery with up to 11 hours of talk time and up to 560 hours of standby time\",\"storage\":\"33GB\",\"RAM\":\"3GB\",\"network technology\":\"HSPA/ GSM/ LTE\",\"display\":\"5.0-inch Full HD IPS LCD display with 1920 x 1080 pixels resolution\"}', '[\"7d0f7f27786240012b.png\",\"6ab0da33ffd0f1045b.png\",\"0bb6c8b2f9c4e208c1.png\",\"879b30e4bf18f7e822.png\",\"f742c6aed05ac612ff.png\",\"e659caadd889cef91e.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"used\",\"price\":90000,\"newprice\":90000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{\"delivery duration\":\"1 - 2 days\"}', 'active', '2024-01-22 22:16:10'),
('19e5b076db5e3d99a3', 'Samsung Galaxy A10s A107M/DS, 4G LTE, International Model, 32GB, 2GB RAM', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'samsung', 'Galaxy A', 'other', 1000, 'The Samsung Galaxy A10s A107M/DS is an international model with no US warranty. It features 4G LTE connectivity, 32GB of internal storage and 2GB of RAM. The phone has a 6.2-inch HD+ Infinity-V Display, a 13MP + 2MP dual rear camera setup, and an 8MP front-facing camera. It runs on Android 9.0 Pie with Samsung\'s One UI and is powered by an octa-core processor clocked at 2.0GHz. Other features include a rear-mounted fingerprint sensor, face recognition, and a 4000mAh battery with 15W fast chargin', '{\"RAM\":\"2GB\",\"storage\":\"32GB\",\"network technology\":\"GSM/ HSPA/ LTE \",\"main camera\":\"Dual rear camera setup (13MP main camera + 2MP depth sensor)\",\"selfie camera\":\"single 8MP front-facing camera\",\"battery\":\" Li-Po 4000 mAh non-removable\",\"display\":\"6.2-inch HD+ Infinity-V\",\"CPU\":\"Octa-core processor clocked at 2.0GHz\",\"sensors\":\"Fingerprint (rear-mounted), accelerometer, proximity\"}', '[\"aca0ed98eebc4faa78.jpeg\",\"8c284150a6bec7e112.jpeg\",\"8a3c0cc4be339b813a.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"used\",\"price\":100000,\"newprice\":100000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
