('1ce9aadf4d0790fcaf', 'blackmagic Design Pocket Cinema Camera 6K ', 'cameras', 'digital cameras', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'other', 5, 'The Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K Pro is a high-end camera designed for professional filmmakers and videographers. It features a Super 35-sized sensor with a resolution of 6144 x 3456, allowing for high-quality footage with impressive detail and dynamic range. It also supports up to 60 frames per second at 6K resolution, or up to 120 frames per second at 2.8K resolution, making it suitable for slow-motion shots.\n\nIn addition, the Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K Pro comes with a range of ', '{\"Brand\":\"Black magic\",\"connectivity\":\"Bluetooth & USB\",\"Flash memory type\":\"SDXC\",\"Color\":\"black\",\"Lens\":\"Not available\",\"Video capture resolution\":\"6K\",\"Batteries\":\"2 Batteries\",\"charger\":\"X1\"}', '[\"767c55e7359b4251a2.png\",\"434503d5cc5a0328bd.png\",\"a3342035d6a42eb328.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":2500000,\"newprice\":2500000,\"promotion\":null},{\"name\":\"open box\",\"price\":1900000,\"newprice\":1900000,\"promotion\":null},{\"name\":\"used \",\"price\":1600000,\"newprice\":1600000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'product on order', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
