('209bc46fb68d3cea87', 'WD 500 GB,320GB,1TB Internal Laptop Hard Disk', 'accessories', 'laptop accessories', 'WD', 'WD Laptop HDD', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 1000, 'WD Internal Laptop Hard Disk is a type of internal hard drive designed for laptops. It offers reliable and high-speed storage capacity for users who need to store large files, such as videos, photos, and documents. This hard disk is manufactured by Western Digital, a leading provider of data storage solutions.\n\nThe WD Internal Laptop Hard Disk is available in various storage capacities, ranging from 250GB to 2TB. It features a 2.5-inch form factor, making it compatible with most laptops. This ha', '{\"form factor\":\" 2.5-inch\",\"RPM (Rotations Per Minute)\":\"5400-7200\",\"Cache\":\"8MB-16MB\",\"capacity\":\"500 GB,320GB,1TB\",\"interface\":\"SATA 6 Gb/s\",\"Transfer rate (max sustained)\":\"140 MB/s\",\"Read speed\":\"up to 110 MB/s\",\"Write speed\":\"up to 105 MB/s\"}', '[\"94cfc0b418e81ced94.jpeg\",\"725316dfc001b670ab.jpeg\",\"a1576f3de827444cdf.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new 1TB\",\"price\":35000,\"newprice\":35000,\"promotion\":null},{\"name\":\"new 500 GB\",\"price\":24000,\"newprice\":24000,\"promotion\":null},{\"name\":\"new 320 GB\",\"price\":14000,\"newprice\":14000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('2867c7b354dfe01ba4', 'Canon EOS R6', 'cameras', 'digital cameras', 'canon', 'image Runner', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 11, 'The Canon EOS R6 is a high-performance mirrorless camera designed for enthusiasts and professionals alike. Here\'s a description of its key features\nThe R6 features a 20.1-megapixel full-frame CMOS sensor, providing excellent image quality, especially in low light conditions\nDesigned for durability, the R6 features a weather-sealed magnesium alloy body, making it resistant to dust and moisture, suitable for use in various shooting conditions\nOverall, the Canon EOS R6 combines advanced features, e', '{\"Image Sensor\":\"20.1 Megapixel Full-Frame CMOS Sensor\",\"Image Processor\":\"DIGIC X Image Processor\",\"Autofocus\":\"Dual Pixel CMOS AF 1053 AF Points (100% Horizontal, 90% Vertical Coverage) Eye Detection AF (Human and Animal) AF Working Range: -6.5 EV to 20 EV\",\"Continuous Shooting\":\"    Up to 12 fps with Mechanical Shutter     Up to 20 fps with Electronic Shutter\",\"Video Recording\":\"    4K UHD (3840 x 2160) at up to 60p     Full HD (1920 x 1080) at up to 120p\",\"Battery\":\"    LP-E6NH Rechargeable Lithium-Ion Battery     Approximately 510 Shots (CIPA)\",\"Dimensions (WxHxD)\":\"Approx. 138.4 x 97.5 x 88.4 mm\"}', '[\"d9ba6db28c265c851d.jpeg\",\"34c9b56cd45e0b7f00.jpeg\",null,null]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":2496120,\"newprice\":2496120,\"promotion\":null}]', 'product on order', 0, '{\"delivery duration\":\"5-10 days\"}', 'active', '2024-02-13 12:23:04'),
('2b425518c40f6ae346', 'Lenovo Ideapad 3 Laptop, 15.6', 'computers', 'laptops', 'lenovo', 'ideaPad', 'office', 997, 'The Lenovo Ideapad 3 is a versatile laptop with a 15.6-inch HD touchscreen that is perfect for both work and entertainment. It features an 11th Gen Intel Core i3-1115G4 processor, 8GB of DDR4 RAM, and a 500GB HDD for efficient performance and storage.\n\nThe laptop includes an HDMI port, webcam, Wi-Fi 5, and Bluetooth connectivity for seamless connectivity. Its Windows 11 Home operating system provides a user-friendly interface, and its Almond color adds a stylish touch to its design.\n\nOverall, th', '{\"CPU\":\"AMD Ryzen™ 7 (5700U) mobile processor.\",\"RAM\":\"8GB\",\"storage\":\"500GB HDD\"}', '[\"220903c5bf1c05bd5c.jpeg\",\"6926cd56975afa6fa9.jpeg\",\"930a1f43d3a77b8ca5.jpeg\",\"b5591ba7c80b965606.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":220000,\"newprice\":220000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 3, '{\"delivery duration\":\"2 days\"}', 'active', '2024-03-17 11:05:31'),
('2b6320a692d03b7047', 'HDMI to Display cable', 'accessories', 'desktop accessories', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 49, 'HDMI (High-Definition Multimedia Interface) is a standard for transmitting digital audio and video signals between devices. On the other hand, \"Display cable\" could refer to various types of cables used to connect devices to displays.\nIf you are looking to connect a device with an HDMI output to a display, you would typically use an HDMI cable. HDMI cables are widely used for connecting devices such as laptops, desktop computers, gaming consoles, Blu-ray players, and more to monitors, TVs, or pr', '{\"Connectors\":\"The connectors are usually labeled as Type A (standard HDMI), Type C (Mini HDMI), or Type D (Micro HDMI), depending on the size of the connector.\",\"Versions\":\"HDMI cables come in different versions, such as HDMI 1.4, HDMI 2.0, and HDMI 2.1. The version can affect the supported resolutions, refresh rates, and additional features like support for HDR (High Dynamic Range).\",\"Audio and Video\":\"HDMI supports the transmission of both audio and video signals over a single cable, simplifying connections.\",\"Resolution\":\"HDMI cables can support various resolutions, including standard HD (1080p), 4K, and even 8K in the case of HDMI 2.1.\"}', '[\"c2f1922f792dad0598.png\",\"4fe5766f637c6f0112.png\",\"173835b8d1aa5bf140.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":13000,\"newprice\":13000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 1, '{\"delivery duretion\":\"1 day\"}', 'active', '2024-02-03 16:08:18'),
('2c0bb3bf7e8cc7b4cf', 'Dell Laptop Charger 45W watt USB Type C (USB-C) AC Power Adapter', 'accessories', 'laptop accessories', 'dell', 'Dell cables', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 1000, 'Description: The Dell Laptop Charger 45W is a compact and lightweight USB Type C (USB-C) AC power adapter designed for Dell laptops. It features a built-in USB-C cable and provides 45 watts of power, making it a great option for users who need to charge their laptop on-the-go or in tight spaces.', '{\"Maximum Voltage\":\"300V\",\"Maximum Amperage\":\"10A\",\"Maximum Wattage\":\"3000W\",\"length\":\"1.2 Meter\",\"Input\":\"100V-240V\",\"output\":\"19.5V, 3.34A\",\"Overload protection\":\"short circuit protection, over-temperature protection, over voltage protection, and over current protection\",\"design\":\"Lightweight and compact design for portability\",\"input frequency\":\"50-60 Hz\",\"wattage\":\"45W\",\"Output voltage\":\"5V DC, 9V DC, 15V DC, 20V DC\",\"connector type\":\"USB Type C (USB-C)\",\"compatibility\":\"Dell laptops with USB-C charging ports (including XPS 13, Inspiron 14 7000, Latitude 5285 2-in-1, and more)\"}', '[\"94ee90828b31173aee.png\",\"839d122fe0b07f134c.png\",\"3a8acd68a3b04ae82a.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":35000,\"newprice\":35000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('2df7f70ea1e545d8b4', 'Lenovo Thinkpad 90W Slim Tip Standard USB AC Adapter for Slim Tip Models Only', 'accessories', 'laptop accessories', 'lenovo', 'Lenovo Cables', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 1000, 'The Lenovo Thinkpad 90W Slim Tip Standard AC Adapter is a high-quality charger designed for use with compatible slim tip models of Lenovo Thinkpad laptops. This adapter delivers 90 watts of power to charge your laptop quickly and efficiently.\n\nThe slim tip design of this adapter ensures a secure and stable connection to your laptop, with a compact and lightweight design that makes it easy to take with you on the go. It also features overvoltage protection to prevent damage to your laptop from po', '{\"input\":\"100-240V AC, 50-60Hz, 1.5A\",\"output\":\"20V DC, 4.5A, 90W\",\"connector\":\"Slim Tip\",\"compatibility\":\"This adapter is compatible with Lenovo ThinkPad laptops that use a slim tip power connector\"}', '[\"b0ae9cfe956e79260a.jpeg\",\"38d242030b1b43fd5d.jpeg\",\"c8423cbeca79289e92.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":7000,\"newprice\":7000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
