('48b91d4b8d7038bcf3', 'Dell BigPin Laptop Charger Adapter 64W 240V for Alienware, Inspiron 15, Latitude and 15 Models ', 'accessories', 'laptop accessories', 'dell', 'Dell cables', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 1000, 'A Dell big pin cable is a proprietary charging cable used to charge Dell laptops and other devices. It is typically designed with a larger, circular pin connector that plugs into the device and a standard AC power plug that plugs into a wall outlet. The cable is used to provide power to the device and charge its battery.\n\n<b>NB:</b> the power cord is bought separately', '{\"Connector\":\"1 x Big Pin (7.4mm) Male\",\"Cable Type\":\"SVT 3/C 18AWG (0.824 mm²) 300V VW-1 75°C\",\"Maximum Voltage\":\"300V\",\"Maximum Amperage\":\"10A\",\"Maximum Wattage\":\"3000W\",\"length\":\"1.2 Meter\"}', '[\"009c7cece9a555c254.jpeg\",\"40e53a5167f2d4214f.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":7000,\"newprice\":7000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{\"pickup location\":\"office\"}', 'active', '2024-01-22 00:48:02'),
