('4fcae6d7f79e0eee57', 'Huawei Nova 2 Plus Dual SIM - 128GB, 4GB RAM, 4G LTE', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'Huawei', 'Huawei Nova Series', 'other', 1000, 'The Huawei Nova 2 Plus is a stunning smartphone that combines powerful performance with a sleek design. With its 5.5-inch Full HD display, you\'ll enjoy a vivid and immersive viewing experience that brings your favorite content to life. The phone is powered by an octa-core Kirin 659 processor and 4GB RAM, ensuring smooth and speedy performance. The 20-megapixel rear camera with f/1.8 aperture and 12-megapixel front-facing camera with soft LED flash make taking stunning photos a breeze. With its l', '{\"Operating System\":\"Android 9.0 Pie\",\"Network Technology\":\"GSM / HSPA / LTE\",\"main camera\":\"12 MP, f/1.8, 1/2.9, 1.25µm, PDAF 8 MP, f/2.4, 1/4, 1.12µm\",\"selfie camera\":\" Single 20 MP, f/2.0, (wide), 1/2.8, 1.0µm\",\"Features Sensors\":\"Fingerprint (rear-mounted), accelerometer, proximity, compass\",\"Battery\":\"Non-removable Li-Po 3340 mAh battery\",\"RAM\":\"4 GB\",\"Storage\":\"128 GB\",\"CPU\":\"Octa-core (4x2.36 GHz Cortex-A53 & 4x1.7 GHz Cortex-A53)\"}', '[\"317fc2873ef6a418fa.png\",\"ec4b4a004cdb5d2117.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"used\",\"price\":135000,\"newprice\":135000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('507c82a9fef5b2448d', 'Samsung Galaxy A50 A505F 128GB Dual SIM Unlocked GSM Phone w/ Triple (25MP+8MP+5MP) Camera - Black', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'samsung', 'Galaxy A', 'other', 3000, 'The Samsung Galaxy A50 mobile features a 6.4\" (16.26 cm) display with a screen resolution of 1080 x 2340 pixels and runs on Android v9.0 (Pie) operating system. The device is powered by Octa core (2.3 GHz, Quad core, Cortex A73 + 1.7 GHz, Quad core, Cortex A53) processor paired with 4 GB of RAM. As far as the battery is concerned it has 4000 mAh. Over that, as far as the rear camera is concerned this mobile has a 25MP + 5MP + 8MP camera . Other sensors include Light sensor, Proximity sensor, Acc', '{\"storage\":\"64GB\",\"RAM\":\"4GB\",\"CPU\":\"Octa-core (4x2.3 GHz Cortex-A73 & 4x1.7 GHz Cortex-A53)\",\"Battery\":\"Li-Po 4000 mAh, non-removable\",\"Main camera\":\"tripple 25MP, 8MP, 5MP\",\"Selfie camera\":\"single 25MP\"}', '[\"4c1abda423f0e34825.jpeg\",\"73b81012b5584696bc.jpeg\",\"9677d35f7e198881cf.jpeg\",\"dbd845cc25ead08854.jpeg\",\"00cd4e889a427a25cb.jpeg\",\"bce21964664a090e01.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":149900,\"newprice\":149900,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('517db19b1a884c7f1d', 'Dell small blue pin Laptop Adapter Charger 65w 19.5V 3.34A (New Pin 4.5*3.0mm) for all Dell Part No. RFRWK 00285K 04H6NV 04H6VH 070VTC ', 'accessories', 'laptop accessories', 'dell', 'Dell cables', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 998, 'Dell Small Blue Pin laptop charger is a power adapter designed for Dell laptops that use a small blue pin connector. It provides reliable power supply for your laptop, allowing you to work uninterrupted for longer hours.<p>\n<b>NB:</b> the power cord is bought separately</p>', '{\"Maximum Voltage\":\"300V\",\"Maximum Amperage\":\"10A\",\"Maximum Wattage\":\"3000W\",\"length\":\"1.2 Meter\",\"Input\":\"100V-240V\",\"output\":\"19.5V, 3.34A\",\"Wattage\":\"65W\",\"Overload protection\":\"short circuit protection, over-temperature protection, over voltage protection, and over current protection\",\"design\":\"Lightweight and compact design for portability\"}', '[\"e64e50169d697949e5.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":10000,\"newprice\":10000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 2, '{\"pickup location\":\"office\"}', 'active', '2024-01-22 10:30:50'),
('56dd655c56e2af44fd', 'Lenovo 65W Computer Charger - Round Tip AC Wall Adapter (GX20L29355),black', 'accessories', 'laptop accessories', 'lenovo', 'Lenovo Cables', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 998, 'The Lenovo 65W Computer Charger is a reliable and efficient AC wall adapter for powering your laptop. It is designed with a round tip that is compatible with most Lenovo laptops, making it a versatile charging solution. The charger features a compact and lightweight design, making it easy to carry around and store when not in use.\n\nThis charger is perfect for use at home, in the office, or on the go. It provides a reliable and fast charging experience, so you can stay productive and connected wi', '{\"input\":\"100-240V AC, 50-60Hz, 1.5A\",\"output\":\"20V DC, 3.25A, 65W\",\"connector type\":\"Round Tip\",\"compatibility\":\"Most Lenovo laptops with a Round Tip connector\"}', '[\"b2c962cbfda117e677.jpeg\",\"ea745084880c957541.webp\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":10000,\"newprice\":10000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 2, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-23 12:08:38'),
('5774ab23f29baff66a', 'Lencs 70-200 ', 'cameras', 'digital cameras', 'canon', 'image Runner', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 11, 'The 70-200mm lens is a versatile telephoto zoom lens that\'s highly popular among photographers due to its wide range of applications and high-quality results. Here\'s a description of its features and typical usage:\n\nFocal Length Range The 70-200mm focal length range provides a significant zoom capability, allowing photographers to capture a wide variety of subjects from a distance.\n\nAperture Range Many 70-200mm lenses offer a wide maximum aperture range, typically around f/2.8 or f/4. This wide ', '{\"Image Sensor\":\"20.1 Megapixel Full-Frame CMOS Sensor\",\"Image Processor\":\"DIGIC X Image Processor\",\"Autofocus\":\"Dual Pixel CMOS AF 1053 AF Points (100% Horizontal, 90% Vertical Coverage) Eye Detection AF (Human and Animal) AF Working Range: -6.5 EV to 20 EV\",\"Continuous Shooting\":\"    Up to 12 fps with Mechanical Shutter     Up to 20 fps with Electronic Shutter\",\"Video Recording\":\"    4K UHD (3840 x 2160) at up to 60p     Full HD (1920 x 1080) at up to 120p\",\"Battery\":\"    LP-E6NH Rechargeable Lithium-Ion Battery     Approximately 510 Shots (CIPA)\",\"Dimensions (WxHxD)\":\"Approx. 138.4 x 97.5 x 88.4 mm\"}', '[\"754e7ca1c19ef4fc2b.jpeg\",\"1846ddcaae6fb0c569.jpeg\",null]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":1096710,\"newprice\":1096710,\"promotion\":null}]', 'product on order', 0, '{\"delivery duration\":\"5-10 days\",\"derivery duration\":\"5-10 days\"}', 'active', '2024-02-13 12:30:47'),
('5e54441706906f556f', 'Samsung Galaxy A5 (2017) SM-A520F/DS 32GB,3GB 5.2\", Dual Sim, Unlocked', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'samsung', 'Galaxy A', 'other', 1000, 'The Samsung Galaxy A5 (2017) features a 5.2-inch Super AMOLED display, 16MP front and rear cameras with f/1.9 aperture, an Exynos 7880 octa-core processor clocked at 1.9 GHz, 3GB of RAM, and 32GB of internal storage that\'s expandable up to 256GB via microSD. It runs on Android 6.0.1 Marshmallow, upgradeable to Android 8.0 Oreo, and has a non-removable 3000mAh battery with fast charging support. Other features include a fingerprint sensor, NFC, and 4G LTE connectivity.', '{\"RAM\":\"3GB\",\"Storage\":\"32GB\",\"display\":\"5.2 inches Super AMOLED capacitive touchscreen, 1080 x 1920 pixels resolution\",\"CPU\":\"Exynos 7880 Octa-core 1.9 GHz Cortex-A53\",\"main camera\":\"single 16 MP, f/1.9, 27mm (wide), PDAF\",\"selfie camera\":\"single 16 MP, f/1.9, 1080p\",\"battery\":\"Non-removable Li-Ion 3000 mAh battery\",\"sensors\":\" Fingerprint (front-mounted), accelerometer, gyro, proximity, compass, barometer\"}', '[\"6856708395d0f38d39.jpeg\",\"24403f9a2304999b12.jpeg\",\"9105988550057a844c.jpeg\",\"918a89e1d875e5d377.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":115000,\"newprice\":115000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('60a34f31fc54757da3', 'Samsung Galaxy J7 16GB,2GB  G610F/DS Dual SIM - 5.5', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'samsung', 'Galaxy J', 'other', 1000, 'The Samsung Galaxy J7 is a mid-range smartphone that was released in 2015. It has a 5.5-inch Super AMOLED display with a resolution of 720 x 1280 pixels, providing clear and vivid colors. The phone is powered by a Qualcomm Snapdragon 615 or Exynos 7580 processor, depending on the region, and comes with 1.5GB or 2GB of RAM. The J7 also features a 13-megapixel rear camera and a 5-megapixel front-facing camera, which can capture decent photos in good lighting conditions. Additionally, it has a 3000', '{\"RAM\":\"2 GB\",\"Storage\":\"16 GB\",\"Network technology\":\"GSM / HSPA / LTE\",\"body dimensions\":\"152.2 x 78.7 x 7.5 mm (5.99 x 3.10 x 0.30 in)\",\"Display\":\"Super AMOLED capacitive touchscreen, 16M colors Size: 5.5 inches, 83.4 cm2 (~69.6% screen-to-body ratio) Resolution: 720 x 1280 pixels, 16:9 ratio (~267 ppi density) Protection: Corning Gorilla Glass 4\",\"CPU\":\"Octa-core (4x1.4 GHz Cortex-A53 & 4x1.0 GHz Cortex-A53) or Octa-core 1.5 GHz Cortex-A53\",\"main camera\":\" Single 13 MP, f/1.9, 28mm (wide), AF\",\"selfie camera\":\"Single 5 MP, f/2.2, 23mm (wide)\"}', '[\"e2af99d0f717b3dece.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":90000,\"newprice\":90000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('66549fb45973c22c2c', 'Huawei Nova 3i Dual SIM - 128GB, 4GB RAM, 4G LTE', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'Huawei', 'Huawei Nova Series', 'other', 1000, 'The Huawei Nova 3i is a stunning mid-range smartphone that offers a perfect balance of style and performance. It features a large 6.3-inch Full HD+ display with a resolution of 1080 x 2340 pixels, offering an immersive viewing experience for all your favorite content. Powered by an octa-core Kirin 710 processor and 4GB of RAM, this device ensures a smooth and responsive user experience. The Nova 3i also boasts dual rear cameras (16MP + 2MP) and dual front cameras (24MP + 2MP), allowing you to ca', '{\"RAM\":\"4 GB\",\"Storage\":\"128 GB\",\"main camera\":\"Dual 16 MP, f/2.2, PDAF 2 MP, (depth)\",\"selfie camera\":\"Dual 24 MP, f/2.0 2 MP, (depth)\",\"display\":\"IPS LCD capacitive touchscreen, 16M colors Size: 6.3 inches, 97.4 cm² (~82.2% screen-to-body ratio) Resolution: 1080 x 2340 pixels, 19.5:9 ratio (~409 ppi density), Corning Gorilla Glass\",\"battery\":\"Li-Ion 3340 mAh, non-removable\",\"CPU\":\"Octa-core (4x2.2 GHz Cortex-A73 & 4x1.7 GHz Cortex-A53)\",\"Body Dimensions\":\"157.6 x 75.2 x 7.6 mm (6.20 x 2.96 x 0.30 in)\"}', '[\"472cece808cfb4ec39.jpeg\",\"f81af529e716c7465b.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"used\",\"price\":155000,\"newprice\":155000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('6988d6a85b47888c12', 'Western Digital WD Blue 3D NAND Internal PC SSD - SATA III 6 Gb/s, M.2 2280, Up to 560 MB/s - WDS500G2B0B', 'accessories', 'desktop accessories', 'WD', 'WD SSD', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 1000, 'The Western Digital  WD Blue 3D NAND Internal PC SSD is a solid-state drive that provides fast and reliable performance for your desktop computer. this SSD can store a large amount of data, such as applications, documents, videos, and photos. The drive is designed with M.2 2280 form factor and SATA III 6 Gb/s interface, making it compatible with most modern motherboards. It also features 3D NAND technology, which enhances its durability and efficiency.', '{\"Capacity\":\"128GB, 256GB, 512GB, 1TB\",\"Interface\":\"SATA III 6 Gb/s, compatible with SATA II 3 Gb/s and SATA I 1.5 Gb/s \",\"Form Factor\":\"M.2 2280 \",\"Sequential Read Speeds\":\"Up to 560 MB/s\",\"Sequential Write Speeds\":\"Up to 530 MB/s \",\"Random Read (4KB, QD32)\":\"Up to 95,000 IOPS\",\"Random Write (4KB, QD32)\":\"Up to 84,000 IOPS\",\"Endurance (TBW)\":\"200 TBW \",\"MTTF\":\"Up to 1.75 million hours \",\"Dimensions (L x W x H)\":\"80mm x 22mm x 2.38mm\",\"Weight\":\"7.5g\"}', '[\"0b0964bd8bfe354e8c.jpeg\",\"6a4f7ccb283c809415.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new 128GB\",\"price\":23000,\"newprice\":23000,\"promotion\":null},{\"name\":\"256\",\"price\":40000,\"newprice\":40000,\"promotion\":null},{\"name\":\"512\",\"price\":58000,\"newprice\":58000,\"promotion\":null},{\"name\":\"1TB\",\"price\":90000,\"newprice\":90000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56');
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `category`, `subcategory`, `brand`, `family`, `usedin`, `quantity`, `description`, `specifications`, `images`, `conditions`, `availability`, `orders`, `shipment_info`, `status`, `date added`) VALUES
('6a3511fa33fb63ed15', 'Type C to Type C adapter', 'accessories', 'phone accessories', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 100, 'A Chargeur Type C to Type C\" refers to a USB Type-C to USB Type-C charger or cable. This means that both ends of the cable and the corresponding ports on the charger or device are USB Type-C connectors.', '{\"Connector Type\":\"    USB Type-C connectors on both ends, allowing for reversible and easy insertion.\",\"Cable Length\":\"    The length of the cable can vary, typically ranging from a few inches to several feet. Choose a length that suits your needs.\",\"Data Transfer\":\"    USB Type-C cables can support data transfer at high speeds, typically up to USB 3.1 or USB 3.2 standards. This is important if you intend to use the cable for transferring files between devices.\",\"Charging Speed\":\"    The cable may support various charging speeds depending on the power delivery specifications. Some cables are designed for fast charging, and the supported wattage can vary.\"}', '[\"bc7aab6a1dfa5a75ad.png\",\"178e56a345eebb5422.png\",\"400e1fd3e9321275c8.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new \",\"price\":7000,\"newprice\":7000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{\"delivery duration\":\"1 day\"}', 'active', '2024-01-22 10:09:08'),
('6b6b61304bdbbecd1a', 'Samsung Galaxy S10+ Plus Verizon + GSM Unlocked 128GB Black', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'samsung', 'galaxy s', 'other', 3000, 'The Samsung Galaxy S10+ is a high-end smartphone with a 6.4-inch Dynamic AMOLED display, Qualcomm Snapdragon 855 processor or Exynos 9820, and up to 12GB of RAM and 1TB of internal storage. It features a triple-lens rear camera system and a dual-lens front-facing camera with an in-display fingerprint sensor. The 4100mAh battery supports fast and wireless charging and the phone is water and dust resistant. Additional features include Bixby voice assistant and Samsung DeX. With its sleek design an', '{\"Battery\":\"4000 mAh\",\"Main camera\":\"tripple 12MP clear camera\",\"selfie camera\":\"dual 10MP camera\",\"body\":\"Glass front (Gorilla Glass 6) glass aluminum frame\",\"CPU\":\"Octa-core (2x2.73 GHz Mongoose M4 & 2x2.31 GHz Cortex-A75 & 4x1.95 GHz Cortex-A55) - EMEA/LATAM\",\"RAM\":\"12GB\"}', '[\"8a7ab6a90cc5e99b76.jpeg\",\"0c46a922434639f2c7.jpeg\",\"518a288f4d911d5812.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":250000,\"newprice\":250000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('6ca91b9d61c66184d3', 'k35 wireless microphone ', 'accessories', 'phone accessories', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 20, 'EXQUISITE APPEARANCE. The main body of K35 wireless microphone is made of leather grain and spark grain technology, which has a delicate feel and is anti-skid and wear-resistant. Our wireless microphones are the size of a fingertip, comfortable to wear, light to carry, and take up no space.', '{\"Recommended Uses For Product\":\"Vlogging, Recording\",\"Connector Type\":\"3.5 mm Jack\",\"Connectivity Technology\":\"Bluetooth\",\"Brand\":\"Careflection\"}', '[\"6e241fb19b0f430a38.png\",\"8beba601811b8a1462.png\",\"d48d0936d9c7367077.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":30000,\"newprice\":30000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{\"Delivery time\":\"1-2 days\"}', 'active', '2024-01-22 10:12:53'),
('6e5e3dc8212566c40e', 'Huawei P20 Pro 128GB, 6GB  Single-SIM (GSM Only, No CDMA) 4G/LTE Smartphone ', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'Huawei', 'Huawei P Series', 'other', 1000, 'The Huawei P20 Pro is a flagship smartphone that combines cutting-edge technology with an exquisite design. It boasts a large 6.1-inch Full HD+ OLED display with a resolution of 1080 x 2240 pixels, offering vibrant and clear visuals. Powered by an octa-core HiSilicon Kirin 970 processor and 6GB of RAM, this device delivers blazing-fast performance and smooth multitasking. The P20 Pro also features a triple rear camera setup (40MP + 20MP + 8MP) that enables you to capture stunning photos with exc', '{\"Storage\":\"128 GB\",\"Network technology\":\"GSM / HSPA / LTE\",\"RAM\":\"6 GB\",\"Body Dimensions\":\"155 x 73.9 x 7.8 mm (6.10 x 2.91 x 0.31 \",\"display\":\"OLED capacitive touchscreen, 16M colors Size: 6.1 inches, 93.9 cm² (~82.0% screen-to-body ratio) Resolution: 1080 x 2240 pixels, 18.7:9 ratio (~408 ppi density) Protection: Corning Gorilla Glass 5\",\"CPU\":\"Octa-core (4x2.4 GHz Cortex-A73 & 4x1.8 GHz Cortex-A53)\",\"Main Camera\":\"Triple: 40 MP, f/1.8, 27mm (wide), 1/1.7, PDAF/Laser AF 20 MP B/W, f/1.6, 27mm (wide), 1/2.7, PDAF/Laser AF 8 MP, f/2.4, 80mm (telephoto), 1/4.0, PDAF/Laser AF, OIS, 3x optical zoom\",\"selfie camera\":\"Single: 24 MP, f/2.0, 26mm (wide), 1/2.8, 0.9µm Features: Leica optics, HDR\",\"Battery\":\"Li-Po 4000 mAh, non-removable\"}', '[\"11b434a973cf8f234a.jpeg\",\"2e7750ef7e0d4f4e91.jpeg\",\"95b4c129181638baa9.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"used\",\"price\":280000,\"newprice\":280000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('6ee53260ba8deed97d', 'Apple iPhone XR, 128GB, 3GB', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'apple', 'iphone', 'other', 100, 'The iPhone XR is a high-end smartphone from Apple. It features a 6.1 inch Liquid Retina LCD display with a resolution of 828 x 1792 pixels. The device is powered by Apple\'s A12 Bionic chip and comes with 3GB of RAM and either 64GB, 128GB, or 256GB of internal storage. The iPhone XR has a single-camera setup on the rear with a 12-megapixel wide-angle lens and a 7-megapixel front-facing camera for selfies. Other features include Face ID, wireless charging, water and dust resistance, and an edge-to', '{\"connectivity\":\"Dual-SIM support (nano-SIM and eSIM) 4G LTE, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, GPS, NFC, Lightning port\",\"RAM\":\"3GB\",\"other features\":\"Face ID facial recognition technology, Water and dust resistance (IP67), Stereo speakers, No headphone jack\",\"selfie camera\":\"7-megapixel front-facing camera\",\"display\":\"6.1-inch Liquid Retina LCD display with 828 x 1792 pixel resolution and 19.5:9 aspect ratio True Tone support Scratch-resistant glass with oleophobic coating\",\"storage\":\"128GB\",\"CPU\":\"Apple A12 Bionic chip with 64-bit architecture\",\"main camera\":\"Single 12-megapixel rear camera setup (wide-angle lens)\",\"battery\":\"2942mAh capacity Wireless charging support\"}', '[\"fe8ac7d8328fbce4de.jpeg\",\"c53fcf4068d00a89e8.jpeg\",\"526036f14aa680f1a2.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"used\",\"price\":550000,\"newprice\":550000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('7b27ad4e305ed4e8f5', 'HIKVISION 4 CHANEL DVR KIT DS-J142I/7204HQHI', 'cameras', 'CCTV', 'HIKVision', 'DS-J142I/7204HQHI', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 20, 'External Interface\nNetwork Interface1×100Mbps\nUSB InterfaceRear panel: 2 × USB 2.0\nVideo/Audio Input/Output\nVideo InputHDTVI, AHD, CVI, CVBS, IP\nRecording\nEncoding Resolution\nWhen 1080p Lite mode not enabled: 720p/WD1/4CIF/VGA/CIF\n\nWhen 1080p Lite mode enabled: 1080p lite/720p/WD1/4CIF/VGA/CIF\n\nFrame RateMain stream: When 1080p Lite mode not enabled: For 720p stream access: 720p/WD1/4CIF/VGA/CIF@25fps(P)/30fps(N) When 1080p Lite mode enabled: 1080p lite/720p/WD1/4CIF/VGA/CIF@25fps(P)/30fps(N) Su', '{\"MODEL No\":\"DS-J142I/7204HQHI\",\"camera number\":\"4 cameras\",\"resolutions\":\"All channels support synchronous playback at up to 720p resolution\"}', '[\"50b53a0df4c8b4a36d.webp\",\"4e7b6eba9e22b2837b.jpeg\",\"9b45556c1a45ccc580.webp\",\"340cf9887e33340c10.webp\"]', '[{\"name\":\"brand new\",\"price\":180000,\"newprice\":180000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('7fdf7b4a9efa172c48', 'Apple MacBook Air 13in (Mid 2012) - Core i5 1.8GHz, 4GB RAM, 128GB SSD', 'computers', 'laptops', 'apple', 'macbook', 'office', 3000, 'The MacBook Air 2012 is a lightweight laptop with a 13.3-inch LED-backlit display, 1.8GHz Intel Core i5 processor, and 4GB of RAM. It has a 128GB solid-state drive, two USB 3.0 ports, and Wi-Fi and Bluetooth connectivity. Its long battery life can last up to 7 hours of web browsing or 30 days of standby time, the MacBook Air 2012 remains a cost-effective option for those in need of a portable and functional laptop, suitable for everyday tasks.', '{\"Display\":\"13.3-inch (diagonal) high-resolution LED-backlit glossy widescreen display with support for millions of colors\",\"CPU\":\"intel core i5\",\"RAM\":\"4GB\",\"storage\":\"128GB SSD\"}', '[\"27ae43e9427656cafa.png\",\"66e852055e110b4f90.jpeg\",\"a0ee2080db78bb0e0b.webp\"]', '[{\"name\":\"open box\",\"price\":320000,\"newprice\":320000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{\"delivery time\":\"1 - 2 days\"}', 'active', '2024-01-21 16:24:47'),
('862cb27b9be8391689', 'MacBook Air Charger, MacBook Pro Charger, 60W Fast Charger Power Adapter with 2nd Generation Magnetic T-Tip 6ft Cable Replacement for MacBook Pro (2013/2015)', 'accessories', 'laptop accessories', 'apple', 'macbook cables', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 1000, 'The 60W Fast Charger Power Adapter is a replacement charger for MacBook Air and MacBook Pro laptops. It features a 2nd Generation Magnetic T-Tip connector and a 6ft cable, which makes it convenient to use even when your laptop is not close to an outlet. The charger is compatible with MacBook Pro 13\" Retina and MacBook Air 11\" and 13\" models from 2012 and 2015.\n\nThe charger is designed to provide fast and efficient charging for your laptop. It has a maximum output power of 60W and an input voltag', '{\"input voltage\":\"100-240 V\",\"output power\":\"60W\",\"color\":\"white\",\"Connector Type\":\"2nd Generation Magnetic T-Tip\",\"length\":\"1M\",\"compatibility\":\"MacBook Pro 2013, MacBook Air 2011 and 2013\"}', '[\"345d43ae169eac05b2.png\",\"2aec2abea9ad5a3864.png\",\"ed6b613d62ea0a8e34.webp\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":27000,\"newprice\":27000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('86f39eb4a1f34ac1e8', 'Hard Disk Cover', 'accessories', 'laptop accessories', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 50, 'In the context of protecting an external hard drive, a \"Hard Disk Cover\" could refer to a protective case or cover designed to shield an external hard drive from physical damage, dust, and scratches. These covers are typically made of materials like neoprene, EVA (ethylene-vinyl acetate), or other shock-absorbing materials. They often have a zippered or Velcro closure to secure the hard drive inside.', '{\"Compatibility\":\" fit specific sizes of external hard drives 2.5 inches or 3.5 inches\",\"Water Resistance\":\"    Water-resistant or splash-proof features to protect the hard drive from minor spills or exposure to moisture.\",\"Compatibility with Accessories\":\"    Designed to accommodate the hard drive along with its associated cables or adapters.\"}', '[\"38fb0cda4cc5c44af8.jpeg\",\"a4411c15ae20319fa2.webp\",\"aaae9e1b173fedc39d.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":5000,\"newprice\":5000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{\"deliver duration\":\"1 day\"}', 'active', '2024-01-21 16:02:17'),
('889e21edfef9432ac1', 'HP Elitebook 820 G3 Notebook i5 8GB, 256 GB SSD', 'computers', 'laptops', 'hp', 'elitebook', 'office', 20, 'Introducing the HP EliteBook 820 G3: a sleek and powerful business companion designed for professionals on the move.\n\nExperience crystal-clear visuals on the 12.5-inch display, choose the processing power that fits your needs, and enjoy swift performance with solid-state drives.\n\nWork confidently with built-in security features like a fingerprint reader and TPM. Stay connected with a variety of ports and wireless capabilities.\n\nWith all-day battery life and a spill-resistant keyboard, this lapt', '{\"processor\":\"Intel Core i5-6300U (2.4 GHz, up to 3 GHz with Intel Turbo Boost Technology, 3 MB cache, 2 cores)\",\"GPU\":\"Intel HD Graphics 520\",\"RAM\":\"8 GB DDR4 PC4-17000 (Transfer rates up to 2133 MT/s)\",\"Display\":\"12.5 in diagonal LED backlight HD1 Slim eDP SVA Anti-glare (1366 x 768)\",\"Storage\":\"256 GB SSD\",\"battery\":\"3 hrs+\",\"dimensions(mm)\":\"338.00 x 237.00 x 18.90\"}', '[\"a3327889655a3255a0.jpeg\",\"ee1f13db1992060346.jpeg\",\"429bec1996d7fce2d5.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"open box\",\"price\":250000,\"newprice\":250000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{\"delivery time\":\"2 - 3 days\"}', 'active', '2024-01-21 23:50:04'),
