('8a788deb645b15f603', 'HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M283fdw Printer', 'printers', 'HP Printers', 'hp', 'LaserJet', 'office', 10, 'The HP Color LaserJet Pro MFP M283fdw is a multi-function printer that is designed to provide high-quality printing, scanning, copying, and faxing capabilities for small to medium-sized offices. This printer offers fast print speeds of up to 22 pages per minute and can produce professional-quality prints with a resolution of up to 600 x 600 dpi. It also features automatic duplex printing, which helps to save paper and reduce printing costs. With a 50-sheet automatic document feeder and a 250-she', '{\"Print speed\":\"Up to 22 pages per minute (ppm) for both black and color\",\"Print resolution\":\"Up to 600 x 600 dots per inch (dpi)\",\"Duplex printing\":\"Automatic\",\"Scanner type\":\"Flatbed, ADF\",\"Scan resolution\":\"Up to 1200 x 1200 dpi\",\"Scan speed\":\" Up to 26 pages per minute\",\"Scan size (flatbed)\":\"Up to 216 x 297 mm\",\"Scan size (ADF)\":\"Up to 216 x 356 mm\",\"Duplex copying\":\"Manual\",\"aximum number of copies\":\"Up to 99 copies\",\"Processor speed\":\"800 MHz\",\"Memory\":\"256 MB\",\"Power consumption\":\"370 watts (active), 2.7 watts (sleep)\",\"Dimensions (WxDxH)\":\"420 x 384 x 334 mm\",\"Weight\":\"18.7 kg\",\"Connectivity\":\"Wi-Fi, Ethernet, USB 2.0, NFC\",\"Mobile printing\":\"HP Smart app, Apple AirPrint, Mopria-certified, Google Cloud Print 2.0, Wi-Fi Direct printing\",\"Display\":\" 6.8 cm color touchscreen\"}', '[\"d057fd813d0f02a70e.png\",\"37facb7a220d8c7101.png\",\"e51d04277cc370374f.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":975650,\"newprice\":975650,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('8b3ca9609c3e1bf005', 'Samsung Galaxy A71 A715F/DS, 4G LTE, 128GB, 6GB - GSM Unlocked ', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'samsung', 'Galaxy A', 'other', 1000, 'The Galaxy A71 is a mid-range smartphone from Samsung. It has a large 6.7 inch Super AMOLED display with a resolution of 1080 x 2400 pixels. The phone is powered by an octa-core Snapdragon 730 processor and comes with 6GB or 8GB of RAM, and 128GB of internal storage that can be expanded up to 512GB with a microSD card. The device runs on Android 10 with Samsung\'s One UI 2. The A71 has a quad-camera setup on the rear consisting of a 64-megapixel primary sensor, a 12-megapixel ultra-wide lens, a 5', '{\"RAM\":\"6GB\",\"Storage\":\"128GB\",\"battery\":\" Non-removable 4000mAh battery with fast charging support\",\"sensors\":\"In-display fingerprint sensor, accelerometer, gyro, proximity, compass\",\"main camera\":\"Quad-camera setup with a 64-megapixel primary sensor, a 12-megapixel ultra-wide lens, a 5-megapixel macro lens, and a 5-megapixel depth sensor\",\"selfie camera\":\"32 MP for selfies\",\"connectivity\":\"Dual-SIM support 4G LTE, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, GPS, NFC, USB Type-C\",\"CPU\":\"Octa-core Qualcomm Snapdragon 730 processor\",\"display\":\"6.7-inch Super AMOLED Plus display with 1080 x 2400 pixel resolution and 20:9 aspect ratio\"}', '[\"1a96abf29adb3d8a6b.jpeg\",\"9becd0f683f3dfcd7e.jpeg\",\"4b538699dfdea040be.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":380000,\"newprice\":380000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('8d6d523abd32d399d4', 'Apple iPhone X, 256GB, 3GB', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'apple', 'iphone', 'other', 100, 'The iPhone X is a high-end smartphone from Apple. It features a 5.8 inch Super Retina OLED display with a resolution of 1125 x 2436 pixels. The device is powered by Apple\'s A11 Bionic chip and comes with 3GB of RAM and either 64GB or 256GB of internal storage. The iPhone X has a dual-camera setup on the rear with a 12-megapixel wide-angle lens and a 12-megapixel telephoto lens, and a 7-megapixel front-facing camera for selfies. Other features include Face ID, wireless charging, water and dust re', '{\"connectivity\":\"Dual-SIM support (nano-SIM and eSIM) 4G LTE, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, GPS, NFC, Lightning port\",\"RAM\":\"3GB\",\"CPU\":\"Apple A11 Bionic chip with 64-bit architecture\",\"display\":\"5.8-inch Super Retina OLED display with 1125 x 2436 pixel resolution and 19.5:9 aspect ratio HDR10 support Scratch-resistant glass with oleophobic coating\",\"other features\":\"Face ID facial recognition technology, Water and dust resistance (IP67), Stereo speakers, No headphone jack\",\"main camera\":\"Dual 12-megapixel rear camera setup (wide-angle and telephoto lenses)\",\"selfie camera\":\"7-megapixel front-facing camera\",\"storage\":\"256 GB\"}', '[\"e286c77d3413b663db.png\",\"ade604785b4d1cc811.png\",\"cc46911533d55f91a5.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"used\",\"price\":450000,\"newprice\":450000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
