('ba179ef10d30f74cca', 'Samsung 4GB DDR3 PC3-12800 1600MHz 204-Pin SODIMM Laptop Memory Module RAM', 'accessories', 'laptop accessories', 'samsung', 'Samsung laptop RAM', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 1000, 'Upgrade your laptop\'s memory with this Samsung 4GB DDR3 SODIMM RAM module. With a clock speed of 1600MHz and a capacity of 4GB, this module provides fast and reliable performance for your laptop. The module is designed to fit into a 204-Pin SODIMM slot, making it compatible with a wide range of laptops.', '{\"capacity\":\"2GB, 4GB, 8GB\",\"Memory Type\":\"DDR3 SODIMM\",\"Memory Speed\":\"1600MHz\",\"Pin Count\":\"204\",\"Latency\":\"CL11\",\"Voltage\":\"1.5V\",\"Form Factor\":\"SODIMM\"}', '[\"73807d67f9f01e90b9.jpeg\",\"98db42b3f4ea6ee5b4.jpeg\",\"79981065c17bce0d66.webp\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new 8GB\",\"price\":17000,\"newprice\":17000,\"promotion\":null},{\"name\":\"new 4GB\",\"price\":8000,\"newprice\":8000,\"promotion\":null},{\"name\":\"new 2GB\",\"price\":4000,\"newprice\":4000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('ba31cd9dfe1f734a79', 'Apple MacBook Pro 15in Retina Late 2013 i7 2.6GHz 16GB 256GB OS X ME874LL/A ', 'computers', 'laptops', 'apple', 'macbook', 'office', 999, 'The MacBook Pro 2013 is a high-performance laptop that features a 13-inch Retina display with a resolution of 2560 x 1600 pixels. It is powered by a 2.4GHz Intel Core i7 processor and 4GB of RAM, providing fast and efficient performance for demanding tasks such as photo and video editing.\n\n', '{\"Screen Size\":\"15.4 inches\",\"Storage\":\"256GB\",\"RAM\":\"4GB\",\"Battery\":\"> 3hrs\"}', '[\"c8ac20fc66d96f2be5.png\",\"f8a56142c660685591.png\",\"977c64a55ee129e5cc.png\",\"184d7aac363466d1e2.png\",\"d5215be29531cc7028.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"used\",\"price\":350000,\"newprice\":350000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 1, '{\"delivery time\":\"2 - 3 days\"}', 'active', '2024-01-23 12:18:48'),
('bd2879a0ebef66a9b3', 'X Printer Original Thermal Printer Xprinter 58mm Cash Receipt', 'printers', 'POS printer', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'office', 20, 'Xprinter XP-58IIL 58mm Thermal Receipt Printer, Invoice Printer, For POS Machine\n● With certificated built in power adapter.\n● Support Chinese GB2312\n● Support Linux,win10 32bits and 64bits & Win8 system\n● Support Logo download print, OPOS application\nPrint width:48mm, Column capacity:384 dots/line\nPrinting speed:90mm/s,Interface:Parallel / USB / Bluetooth+USB / USB+Lan\nPrinting paper:57.5±0.5mm×φ60mm\nWeight:0.79kg,Dimensions:185×132×110mm（D×W×H）\n\nProduct Dimensions: 5.2 x 7.3 x 4.3 inches', '{\"Brand Name \":\"xprinter\",\"Part Number\":\" 58IIL\",\"coonectivity\":\"usb cable\",\"color\":\"black\",\"software\":\"available cd or on our website softwares\"}', '[\"75f64dd1970ce6d78c.png\",\"373ac3196fdca48a52.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"brand new\",\"price\":55000,\"newprice\":55000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('c5b5acc3ec335a7e08', 'Canon Lens 16-35mm', 'cameras', 'digital cameras', 'canon', 'image Runner', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 11, 'The Canon EF 16-35mm f/2.8L III USM is a professional-grade ultra-wide zoom lens designed for Canon DSLR cameras. Here\'s a description of its key features\n\nFocal Length Range The 16-35mm focal length range provides an ultra-wide to wide-angle perspective, making it ideal for capturing expansive landscapes, architecture, int riors, and creative compositions.\n\nAperture With a maximum aperture of f/2.8, this lens excels in low-light conditions and offers excellent control over depth of field. It al', '{\"24.2MP CMOS sensor\":\"Built-in image stabilization rated to 8.0 stops\",\"People, animal, and vehicle AF subject detection\":\"4K/60p video (oversampled from 6K)\",\"6K ProRes RAW video with a compatible Atomos recorder\":\"Raw burst mode with pre-capture\",\"Moving subject HDR mode\":\"3.68M-dot EVF capable of up to 120 fps refresh (0.76x magnification)\"}', '[\"744d2c16d13ff333db.jpeg\",\"4e4d949977870be1bd.jpeg\",\"538621c35d7787af81.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":2957435,\"newprice\":2957435,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{\"delivery duration\":\"5-10 days\"}', 'active', '2024-02-13 12:51:53'),
('c8f6fe51169a858590', 'HP ProBook 640 G1 Intel Dual Core i5-4300M with Intel HD Graphics (2.6 GHz, 3M Cache, Max Turbo Frequency 3.3GHz) 8GB DDR3 RAM 500GB HDD', 'computers', 'laptops', 'hp', 'ProBook', 'other', 10, 'The HP ProBook 640 is a sleek and powerful laptop designed for professionals who demand performance and portability. With a stylish silver finish, this laptop boasts a 14-inch diagonal FHD display that delivers crisp and vibrant visuals. Its backlit keyboard allows for comfortable typing in any lighting condition, making it ideal for working on-the-go.\n\nUnder the hood, the ProBook 640 packs a punch with its 10th Generation Intel Core i5 processor and 8GB of DDR4 memory, ensuring seamless multita', '{\"RAM\":\"8 GB\",\"Storage\":\"500 GB HDD\",\"GPU\":\"Intel HD Graphics\",\"CPU\":\"Intel Dual Core i5-4300M  2.6 GHz, 3M Cache, Max Turbo Frequency 3.3GHz\",\"Sound system\":\"Dual speakers, integrated microphone (array)\"}', '[\"4baa81c6f6c7a19267.png\",\"c80de2d3f6192ab331.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"open box\",\"price\":280000,\"newprice\":280000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('cb196bea883b3bcc58', 'Samsung 8GB DDR4 PC4-21300, 2666MHZ, 260 PIN SODIMM, 1.2V, CL 19 Laptop ram Memory Module', 'accessories', 'laptop accessories', 'samsung', 'Samsung laptop RAM', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 1000, 'The Samsung  DDR4 PC4-21300 is a high-performance laptop memory module designed to provide efficient and reliable performance. It operates at a frequency of 2666MHz, ensuring fast data transfer rates. The module uses a 260-pin SODIMM form factor and has a voltage rating of 1.2V, which helps reduce power consumption and prolong battery life. The CL 19 latency rating ensures that data is processed quickly and efficiently, resulting in smooth and responsive system performance. This memory module is', '{\"capacity\":\"4GB, 8GB, 16GB, 128GB\",\"Latency\":\"CL19\",\"Voltage\":\"1.2V\",\"pin count\":\"260 pins\",\"memory Type\":\"DDR4 SODIMM\",\"form factor\":\"SODIMM\",\"memory Speed\":\"PC4-21300 / 2666MHz\"}', '[\"58f1828e21f4b190ad.png\",\"3d68fb8ff09dd0c044.png\",\"f5260e9e0b12ceb985.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new 4GB\",\"price\":25000,\"newprice\":25000,\"promotion\":null},{\"name\":\"new 8GB\",\"price\":40000,\"newprice\":40000,\"promotion\":null},{\"name\":\"new 16GB\",\"price\":75000,\"newprice\":75000,\"promotion\":null},{\"name\":\"new 128GB\",\"price\":180000,\"newprice\":180000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('cf90d2ca1b00d38a90', 'Apple iPhone XS Max, US Version, 512GB, Silver', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'apple', 'iphone', 'other', 3000, 'The Apple iPhone XS Max, US version, with 512GB of storage in Silver is a premium smartphone that offers exceptional performance and features. The phone boasts a stunning 6.5-inch Super Retina display, delivering vivid and lifelike visuals. Powered by the A12 Bionic chip, the phone offers blazing-fast performance and is capable of running the most demanding apps with ease. The phone features an advanced dual-lens camera system that captures stunning photos and videos with features such as Smart ', '{\"Main camera\":\"Dual 12MP \",\"Selfie camera\":\"single 7MP\",\"color\":\"black\",\"dimensions\":\"158.2 x 77.9 x 7.3 mm (6.23 x 3.07 x 0.29 in)\",\"RAM\":\"4 GB\",\"Storage\":\"512 GB\",\"Battery\":\"Li-Ion 3174 mAh, non-removable (12.08 Wh)\"}', '[\"a15bc0d494d6ea18c3.png\",\"9cd1998dbfc4b9ba97.png\",\"6121e465a653eeb11c.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"used\",\"price\":393000,\"newprice\":393000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('d2e59dd20fe770f113', 'Google Pixel 7 Pro 5G 128GB 12GB RAM 24-Hour Battery Universal Unlocked for All Carriers - Obsidian', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'google', 'Pixel', 'other', 5000, 'Pixel 7 is super fast and responsive, with an adaptive battery and so much more. for even more power. The powerful new processor is custom built with Google AI and makes Pixel 7 faster, more efficient, and more secure. It delivers even more helpful features and Pixel\'s best photo and video quality yet.', '{\"CPU\":\"Octa-core (2x2.85 GHz Cortex-X1 & 2x2.35 GHz Cortex-A78 & 4x1.80 GHz Cortex-A55)\",\"body\":\"Glass front (Gorilla Glass Victus), glass back (Gorilla Glass Victus), aluminum frame\",\"RAM\":\"12GB\",\"Storage\":\"512GB\",\"main camera\":\"tripple 50MP, 48MP, 12MP\",\"selfie camera\":\"10.8MP single\",\"Battery\":\"5000 mAh\",\"network\":\"GSM / CDMA / HSPA / EVDO / LTE / 5G\"}', '[\"0022f4ff1eb3a24630.jpeg\",\"97f08a18cfd3e2c31f.jpeg\",\"76d43d518f3c98da82.jpeg\",\"4873882009d56cbb29.jpeg\",\"5d56fbc0b40f44d0b7.jpeg\",\"c2bc593181d0578d92.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":727400,\"newprice\":727400,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('d3d49ac28e93f73cda', 'K8 wireless microphone', 'accessories', 'phone accessories', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 100, 'Enable OTG on Phone before use. Can be enabled with Micro USB + Type C + iphone + USB plug to any adapters. Compatible with iPhone/ iPad & Android smartphones, tablet, Computers The microphone can be used directly when you play Youtube / TikTok / WhatsApp or Facebook, Conventional Bluetooth ones fail to realize, Built-in Omnidirectional Condenser Microphone, it Captures Sound in Every Direction.Using real-time auto-sync technology, which Enhaces Quality, Easy to use, switch on and plug in the re', '{\"Transmission frequency\":\"2.4GHz-2.4835GHz\",\"Operating distance\":\"up to 10 meters\",\"Signal-to-noise ratio\":\"> 85dB\"}', '[\"7d3d4ae9badb2fd264.webp\",\"278daf926e608b7ec9.png\",\"1133fd7f4914036237.webp\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":18000,\"newprice\":18000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{\"delivery duration\":\"1 - 2 days\"}', 'active', '2024-01-21 14:52:38'),
('d4348330f8f0a82e0e', 'Apple iPhone 6S Plus - 64GB, 4G LTE, Gold', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'apple', 'iphone', 'other', 5000, 'The Apple iPhone 6S Plus with FaceTime is a premium smartphone that boasts a stunning design and exceptional features. With its 64GB internal storage capacity, it provides ample space to store all your apps, media, and documents. The phone is equipped with a powerful 4G LTE modem that allows for lightning-fast internet speeds, ensuring that you stay connected wherever you go. The gorgeous gold finish adds a touch of sophistication and elegance to the device. The highlight of the iPhone 6S Plus i', '{\"RAM\":\"2GB\",\"Product Dimensions\":\"‎15.82 x 0.74 x 7.8 cm; 190.51 Grams\",\"color\":\"Gold\"}', '[\"ca45c37b57f62a554f.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":122190,\"newprice\":122190,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('d51e91bef00618e634', 'Apple iPhone 8 Plus with FaceTime - 256GB, 4G LTE, Gold, 5.5 Inch', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'apple', 'iphone', 'other', 3000, 'The Apple iPhone 8 Plus with FaceTime is a stunning smartphone that combines style and functionality in one sleek package. With a massive 256GB of internal storage, this phone provides plenty of space for all your photos, videos, music, and documents. It is equipped with a powerful 4G LTE modem that delivers blazing-fast internet speeds, ensuring that you stay connected no matter where you are. The gorgeous gold finish gives this phone a premium look and feel, making it stand out from the crowd.', '{\"color\":\"Gold\",\"Networking topology\":\"4G LTE\",\"storage\":\"256 GB\",\"RAM\":\"3GB\",\"Main camera\":\"Dual 12 MP\",\"selfie camera\":\"single 7MP\"}', '[\"a96cc07b351eb01653.jpeg\",\"3e06a839f6b19d8b28.jpeg\",\"ddbe9d2bcaef19ef4c.jpeg\",\"6ac87503d8d7de8272.jpeg\",\"0430b245cf654755ab.jpeg\",\"d413a0379ff7f24790.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":253000,\"newprice\":253000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('dd5f77f745df00ad7d', '65w Big Pin Laptop Charger for HP EliteBook Folio 840 450 9480m 9470m ProBook 430 G1 G2 440 455 645 650 655 250 255 EliteBook UL Listed 18.5V 3.5A Power Adapter', 'accessories', 'laptop accessories', 'hp', 'HP cables', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 3000, 'Output:DC 18.5V 3.5A 65W; Input:AC 100-240V 50-60Hz; Prongs:3-Prong; Connector Size:7.4*5.0mm\nCompatibility:  HP EliteBook Revolve 810 G1 G2, 820 G1, 840 G1, 850 G1, 725 G2, 745 G2, 755 G2; HP EliteBook Folio 9470m 9480m; HP ProBook 430 G1 G2, 440 G1, 450 G1, 455 G1, 645 G1, 650 G1, 655 G1; HP 250, 255 G\nFits for 2000-2a10nr 2000-2a20nr 2000-2b09wm 2000-2b10nr 2000-2b16nr 2000-2b19wm 2000-2b20nr 2000-2b22dx 2000-2b30dx 2000-2b43dx 2000-2B44DX 2000-2b80dx 2000-2b89wm 2000-2c20dx 2000-2C20NR 2000-', '{\"Connectivity Technology\":\"AC Adapter\",\"Connector Type\":\"7.4*5.0mm\",\"Compatible Devices\":\"Hp elitebook folio 9470m 9480m, hp elitebook 840-g2 645-g1, hp Laptops...\",\"Included Components\":\"1x AC Power Cable, 1x 65W AC Adapter\",\"Special Feature\":\"Short Circuit Protection\",\"Color\":\"Black\",\"Input Voltage\":\"220V~240V\",\"output voltage\":\"19V\",\"length\":\"1.5m\"}', '[\"a8db9768494317bf33.png\",\"1f813f6b2d4d7c1631.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":12000,\"newprice\":12000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('ded9787b0043d1be06', 'HP Adapter Charger for HP 18.5v 3.5A 65W Yellow Pin Lapcare Compatible', 'accessories', 'laptop accessories', 'hp', 'HP cables', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 1000, 'This is a compatible replacement charger for HP laptops with a yellow pin connector. It has an output voltage of 18.5 volts and a current rating of 3.5 amps, providing a total power output of 65 watts. The charger is designed to be lightweight and portable, making it a convenient choice for travelers and those on-the-go. It is made with high-quality materials and includes safety features to protect against overcharging, overheating, and short-circuits.', '{\"input \":\"100V-240V\",\"output\":\"18.5V, 3.5A, 65W\",\"Connector Size\":\"4.8mm*1.7mm\",\"Compatibility\":\"Compatible with a range of HP laptops\",\"Features\":\"Over-voltage, over-current, and short-circuit protection; energy-saving design; lightweight and compact design for portability\"}', '[\"20fed7eee86652acf5.webp\",\"48828ee65cd141ed6f.jpeg\",\"a10172127a94802b7e.webp\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":12000,\"newprice\":12000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('e275d16deb9f1b56d5', 'Lenovo big-pin laptop adapter for Thinkpad Z60 Z60m Z60t Z61 Z61e Z61m Z61p Z61t ', 'accessories', 'laptop accessories', 'lenovo', 'Lenovo Cables', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 1000, 'The Lenovo BigPin AC Adapter is a power adapter designed for Lenovo laptops and notebooks. It has a big pin connector that plugs into the laptop\'s charging port, providing a reliable and efficient source of power. With an output voltage of 20V and a maximum power output of 90W, this AC adapter can charge and power a variety of Lenovo laptop models. It also features a built-in over-voltage and short-circuit protection, ensuring safe and reliable operation. The adapter comes with a power cord that', '{\"input \":\"100V-240V\",\"output\":\"20V, 4.5A, 90W\",\"connector\":\"big-pin\",\"compatibility\":\"Lenovo laptop models: ThinkPad T420, T430, T520, T530, W520, W530, X220, X230, X1 Carbon, and more\"}', '[\"7b448d3bc7f488accd.jpeg\",\"4491b7f5b87d5a982d.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":8000,\"newprice\":8000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56');
