('e3056734f6d56c1acb', 'Samsung Galaxy Note8 N950U 64GB Unlocked GSM LTE Android Phone w/ Dual 12 Megapixel Camera', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'samsung', 'Galaxy Note', 'other', 100, 'The Samsung Galaxy Note8 is a flagship smartphone that features a large 6.3-inch Super AMOLED display with a resolution of 2960 x 1440 pixels. The phone is powered by an octa-core processor and 6GB of RAM, making it powerful and efficient.\n\nThe Galaxy Note8 comes with 64GB of internal storage, which can be expanded up to 512GB via a microSD card. The phone features a dual 12MP rear camera with dual OIS and a 8MP front-facing camera, making it perfect for capturing great photos and videos.\n\nOther', '{\"main camera\":\"Dual 12MP with dual OIS, 2x optical zoom and 4K video recording\",\"selfie camera\":\"8MP with autofocus\",\"RAM\":\"6GB\",\"Storage\":\"64GB\",\"CPU\":\"Qualcomm Snapdragon 835 octa-core processor\",\"display\":\"6.3-inch Super AMOLED display with 2960 x 1440 pixels resolution\",\"battery\":\"Non-removable 3300mAh battery with fast charging and wireless charging\",\"connectivity\":\"4G LTE, Wi-Fi 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac, Bluetooth 5.0, NFC, GPS, USB Type-C\",\"sensors\":\"Iris scanner, fingerprint scanner, accelerometer, gyro, proximity, compass, barometer, heart rate, SpO2\"}', '[\"26dd7fbcce77855879.jpeg\",\"e90fceeb550be8b062.jpeg\",\"ff85dd1bad27af77b8.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"used\",\"price\":220000,\"newprice\":220000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('e3a0749d1dd954a595', 'Apple Iphone 11', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'apple', 'iphone', 'other', 100, 'The iPhone 11 is a high-end smartphone from Apple. It features a 6.1 inch Liquid Retina LCD display with a resolution of 828 x 1792 pixels. The device is powered by Apple\'s A13 Bionic chip and comes with 4GB of RAM and either 64GB, 128GB, or 256GB of internal storage. The iPhone 11 has a dual-camera setup on the rear with a 12-megapixel wide-angle lens and a 12-megapixel ultra-wide lens, and a 12-megapixel front-facing camera for selfies. Other features include Face ID, water and dust resistance', '{\"main camera\":\"Dual 12-megapixel rear camera setup (wide-angle and ultra-wide lenses)\",\"selfie camera\":\"12-megapixel front-facing camera\",\"battery\":\"3110mAh battery capacity Wireless charging support\",\"display\":\"6.1-inch Liquid Retina LCD display with 828 x 1792 pixel resolution and 19.5:9 aspect ratio True Tone support Scratch-resistant glass with oleophobic coating\",\"CPU\":\"Apple A13 Bionic chip with 64-bit architecture Neural Engine\",\"RAM\":\"4GB\",\"storage\":\"128GB\",\"connectivity\":\"Dual-SIM support (nano-SIM and eSIM) 4G LTE, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, GPS, NFC, Lightning port\",\"other features\":\"Face ID facial recognition technology, Water and dust resistance (IP68), Stereo speakers, No headphone jack\"}', '[\"c5bec7a560dfb2a252.jpeg\",\"6184a7a451b2829fbb.jpeg\",\"72a1e3f89bef82cad5.jpeg\",\"e1bbf08664ec6a5984.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":750000,\"newprice\":750000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('e3dfb6a35ebac4bfbf', 'Fixed Wireless phone DDK 995+', 'phones', 'fixed phones', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 20, 'If someone mentions a \"fixed phone for the office,\" they are likely referring to a landline telephone that is permanently installed or fixed in a specific location within an office setting. These phones are connected to the office\'s internal telephone system or to external telephone lines. Here are some characteristics and considerations associated with fixed phones for office use', '{\"supports \":\"2 Sim and memory card\",\"Additional Features\":\"Presence indicators to show if a colleague is on a call\",\"Power\":\"Powered through standard electrical outlets\",\"Voicemail\":\"Voicemail support with indicator lights for new messages\",\"Calling Features\":\"Caller ID display Call waiting and call forwarding capabilities Speed dial and programmable memory buttons Redial functionality\"}', '[\"da7b1227173437d263.webp\",\"69e9222492b7363ab6.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":40000,\"newprice\":40000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{\"delivery duretion\":\"1 day\"}', 'active', '2024-01-21 15:51:27'),
('e59609ae2d858cd7db', 'apple iphone 15 pro 8GB RAM, 128GB', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'apple', 'iphone', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 10, 'Elevate your everyday with the iPhone 15. Experience blazing-fast speed, a camera that captures every moment in stunning detail, and a battery that keeps you going. Plus, enjoy an intuitive design that puts everything you need at your fingertips. The iPhone 15 isn\'t just a phone, it\'s a seamless extension of you.', '{\"network technology\":\"GSM / CDMA / HSPA / EVDO / LTE / 5G\",\"body dimensions\":\"146.6 x 70.6 x 8.3 mm (5.77 x 2.78 x 0.33 in)\",\"display type\":\"LTPO Super Retina XDR OLED, 120Hz, HDR10, Dolby Vision, 1000 nits (typ), 2000 nits (HBM)\",\"display resolution\":\"1179 x 2556 pixels, 19.5:9 ratio (~461 ppi density)\",\"OS\":\"iOS 17, upgradable to iOS 17.2\",\"chipset\":\"Apple A17 Pro (3 nm)\",\"GPU\":\"Apple GPU (6-core graphics)\",\"CPU\":\"Hexa-core (2x3.78 GHz + 4x2.11 GHz)\",\"memory\":\"8GB RAM\",\"Storage\":\"128GB 8GB RAM\",\"main camera\":\"48 MP, f/1.8, 24mm (wide), 1/1.28 inches, 1.22µm, dual pixel PDAF, sensor-shift OIS 12 MP, f/2.8, 77mm (telephoto), 1/3.5 inches, 1.0µm, PDAF, OIS, 3x optical zoom 12 MP, f/2.2, 13mm, 120˚ (ultrawide), 1/2.55 inches, 1.4µm, dual pixel PDAF\",\"selfie camera\":\"single, 12 MP, f/1.9, 23mm (wide), 1/3.6 inches, PDAF, OIS SL 3D, (depth/biometrics sensor)\",\"battery\":\"Li-Ion 3274 mAh, non-removable\",\"charging\":\"Wired, PD2.0, 50% in 30 min (advertised) 15W wireless (MagSafe) 15W wireless\"}', '[\"fccf98183dc2959709.jpeg\",\"a1a02ccd1b55f88d79.jpeg\",\"c52927d3757d7c68d7.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":2000000,\"newprice\":2000000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'product on order', 0, '{\"shipping duration\":\"5 - 6 days\"}', 'active', '2024-01-22 00:19:18'),
('e635323860dd1d5bcd', 'Hp Probook 650 G2 Laptop Intel Core i5 2.3 GHz 8GB Ram 500GB HDD Windows 10 Pro', 'computers', 'laptops', 'hp', 'ProBook', 'other', 1000, 'The HP ProBook 650 G2 is a business laptop designed for professionals who require a powerful and reliable device. It features a choice of Intel Core i5 or i7 processors, up to 16GB of DDR4 RAM, and various storage options such as HDD and SSD. The laptop comes with a 15.6-inch anti-glare display, Intel HD graphics or AMD Radeon R7 M365X with 2GB dedicated graphics memory. It also includes a range of security features such as HP Sure Start, HP Client Security, and HP Sure Click. The laptop is cert', '{\"RAM\":\"8 GB DDR3\",\"Storage\":\"500 HDD\",\"CPU\":\"Intel Core i5-6200U processor (2.3 GHz, up to 2.8 GHz with Intel Turbo Boost Technology, 3 MB cache, 2 cores)\",\"Display\":\"15.6 inch diagonal LED-backlit HD anti-glare (1366 x 768)\",\"GPU (graphics)\":\"Intel HD Graphics 520\",\"sound system\":\"HD audio with DTS Studio Sound, 2 integrated stereo speakers, Integrated microphone (dual-microphone array when equipped with optional webcam)\",\"keyboard\":\"HP Premium Spill-resistant Keyboard with Touchpad and drain\",\"Dimensions (W x D x H)\":\"37.8 x 25.7 x 2.74 cm (14.88 x 10.12 x 1.08 in)\"}', '[\"ba360ac66ce542ae9a.jpeg\",\"0ecc67057dc2d52a98.jpeg\",\"91d76e042a756c5e10.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":500000,\"newprice\":500000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('ef7fd6648480622721', 'MacBook Pro Charger, 67W USB C Power Adapter Compatible with MacBook Pro, air 2023 2021, 2020,2019,2018,2017', 'accessories', 'laptop accessories', 'apple', 'macbook cables', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 1000, 'The 67W USB C Power Adapter is a powerful and versatile charger that is compatible with a wide range of devices, including MacBook Pro 13/14 inch 2023 2021, 2020, 2019, 2018, 2017, M2 M1, MacBook Air, iPad Pro, and all USB-C devices. It comes with a 6.6ft USB C to C cable, which makes it easy to use even when your device is not close to an outlet.\n\nThe charger is designed to provide fast and efficient charging for your devices. It has a maximum output power of 67W and an input voltage range of 1', '{\"input voltage\":\"100 ~ 240 v\",\"output power\":\"67W\",\"color\":\"white\",\"Connector Type\":\"USB Type-C\",\"Compatibility\":\"MacBook Pro 13/14 inch 2023 2021, 2020, 2019, 2018, 2017, M2 M1, MacBook Air, iPad Pro, and all USB-C devices.\"}', '[\"f764650dccb4dceb42.png\",\"ab07d88639c06f3037.png\",\"7ac03bf1352c584764.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":40000,\"newprice\":40000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('f1409858f3cb1b7f6e', 'Iphone 12 pro max 256 GB,6GB', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'apple', 'iphone', 'other', 100, 'The iPhone 12 Pro Max is Apple\'s flagship smartphone from the iPhone 12 lineup. It features a 6.7 inch Super Retina XDR OLED display with a resolution of 1284 x 2778 pixels. The device is powered by Apple\'s A14 Bionic chip and comes with 6GB of RAM and either 128GB, 256GB, or 512GB of internal storage. The iPhone 12 Pro Max has a triple-camera setup on the rear with a 12-megapixel wide-angle lens, a 12-megapixel ultra-wide lens, and a 12-megapixel telephoto lens, and a 12-megapixel front-facing ', '{\"display\":\"6.7-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display with 1284 x 2778 pixel resolution and 19.5:9 aspect ratio HDR10, Dolby Vision, and True Tone support Ceramic Shield front cover with oleophobic coating IP68 water and dust resistance\",\"RAM\":\"6GB\",\"Storage\":\"256GB\",\"CPU\":\"Apple A14 Bionic chip with 64-bit architecture Neural Engine\",\"main camera\":\"Triple 12-megapixel rear camera setup (wide-angle, ultra-wide, and telephoto lenses)\",\"selfie camera\":\"12-megapixel front-facing camera\",\"battery\":\"3687mAh battery capacity Fast charging with 20W adapter (sold separately) MagSafe wireless charging up to 15W Qi wireless charging up to 7.5W\",\"connectivity\":\"Dual-SIM support (nano-SIM and eSIM) 5G, 4G LTE, Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.0, GPS, NFC, Lightning port\",\"other features\":\"Face ID facial recognition technology Stereo speakers No headphone jack\"}', '[\"f230a994baba6d1aae.jpeg\",\"900f606affc8bf125b.jpeg\",\"b10fe1ea735c83cd4d.jpeg\",\"abe82935eaab4b4b46.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":1500000,\"newprice\":1500000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('f28dab6ca6e2b0a496', 'Apple iPhone 11 Pro Max (256GB) - Midnight Green', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'apple', 'iphone', 'other', 3000, 'The Apple iPhone 11 Pro Max (256GB) in Midnight Green is a stunning and powerful smartphone that is designed to deliver exceptional performance and features. The phone features a large 6.5-inch Super Retina XDR display that provides an immersive viewing experience with true-to-life colors and incredible detail. Powered by the A13 Bionic chip, the phone is incredibly fast and responsive, making it perfect for multitasking and running demanding apps. The phone features an advanced triple-lens came', '{\"Selfie camera\":\"single 7MP\",\"color\":\"black\",\"dimensions\":\"158.2 x 77.9 x 7.3 mm (6.23 x 3.07 x 0.29 in)\",\"storage\":\"256 GB\",\"battery\":\"Li-Ion 3969 mAh, non-removable (15.04 Wh)\"}', '[\"06df95f0d851c9d065.jpeg\",\"e86c308431ec0e5c59.jpeg\",\"ce4faeded90061df63.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":533100,\"newprice\":533100,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56'),
('f5ad241ed2c262a7dc', 'WD Desktop Hard Disk Drive - 7200 RPM Class SATA 6Gb/s 32MB Cache 3.5 Inch - WD5000AZLX', 'accessories', 'desktop accessories', 'WD', 'WD Desktop HDD', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 1000, 'The WD  Desktop Hard Disk Drive is a high-performance storage solution designed for desktop computers. With a 7200 RPM Class SATA 6Gb/s interface, this hard drive delivers fast data transfer rates and reliable performance. It has a 32MB cache size and a 3.5 inch form factor, making it a great option for desktop computers with plenty of space.\n\nThe drive is designed for use in a variety of applications, including gaming, multimedia, and data-intensive tasks. It features WD\'s NoTouch Ramp Load tec', '{\"Interface\":\"SATA 6 Gb/s\",\"Form Factor\":\"3.5 Inch\",\"RPM Class\":\"7200\",\"Cache\":\"32 MB\",\"capacity\":\"500GB, 1TB, 2TB, 4TB\",\"Advanced Format (AF)\":\"Yes\",\"Dimensions (L x W x H)\":\" 5.8 x 4 x 1 inches\"}', '[\"74a59f24ee0f80d956.png\",\"0191f41b37b9104fb7.png\",\"2eccf13621e15b4c9b.png\",\"bda73085464cbc53eb.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new 500GB\",\"price\":28000,\"newprice\":28000,\"promotion\":null},{\"name\":\"new 1TB\",\"price\":45000,\"newprice\":45000,\"promotion\":null},{\"name\":\"new 2TB\",\"price\":55000,\"newprice\":55000,\"promotion\":null},{\"name\":\"new 4TB\",\"price\":110000,\"newprice\":110000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{\"pickup location\":\"office\"}', 'active', '2024-01-22 10:28:18'),
('f7e80e05b7f51bca55', 'Google pixel 5 128GB, 6GB RAM', 'phones', 'smart phones', 'google', 'Pixel', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 1, 'Welcome to the epitome of Google\'s innovation and seamless performance - the Google Pixel 5. Unveiled in October 2020, this flagship smartphone exemplifies a perfect fusion of cutting-edge technology and sleek design. With a compact aluminum build, an exquisite 6.0-inch OLED display featuring a smooth 90Hz refresh rate, and a powerful Qualcomm Snapdragon 765G chipset, the Pixel 5 is crafted to deliver an exceptional user experience. Capture the world in stunning detail with its dual-camera setup', '{\"Network Technology\":\"GSM / CDMA / HSPA / EVDO / LTE / 5G\",\"Body Dimensions\":\"144.7 x 70.4 x 8 mm (5.70 x 2.77 x 0.31 in)\",\"Display Type\":\"OLED, 90Hz, HDR10+\",\"Display size\":\"6.0 inches, 87.6 cm2 (~85.9% screen-to-body ratio)\",\"Platform OS\":\"Android 11, upgradable to Android 14\",\"Chipset\":\"Qualcomm SM7250 Snapdragon 765G 5G (7 nm)\",\"CPU\":\"Octa-core (1x2.4 GHz Kryo 475 Prime & 1x2.2 GHz Kryo 475 Gold & 6x1.8 GHz Kryo 475 Silver)\",\"RAM\":\"8GB\",\"Internal memory\":\"128 GB\",\"Main Camera\":\"12.2 MP, f/1.7, 27mm (wide), 1/2.55 inches, 1.4µm, dual pixel PDAF, OIS 16 MP, f/2.2, 117˚ (ultrawide), 1.0µm\",\"Battery Type\":\"Li-Po 4080 mAh, non-removable\",\"Charging\":\"18W wired, PD2.0 12W wireless 5W reverse wired\"}', '[\"76fa7ff571c642d4a4.jpeg\",\"7b9b1464969c2009c3.jpeg\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Open Box\",\"price\":230000,\"newprice\":230000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{\"Delivery duration\":\"1 - 2 days approx\"}', 'active', '2024-01-21 13:59:00'),
('f8ec601f31da0b7fe9', '65w USB-c ac Adapter for all new Lenovo ThinkPad laptop models', 'accessories', 'laptop accessories', 'lenovo', 'Lenovo Cables', 'for offce, school, home, personal use,', 1000, 'This 65W USB-C AC adapter is designed specifically for Lenovo Yoga laptops, including the c940, c740, s940, s730, c930, c630, 920, 910, 900, 730, and 720 models. The adapter is compatible with multiple part numbers, including adlx65ylc2a, adlx65ycc2a, adlx65ylc3a, 4X20M26268, 4X20M26252, ADLX65YCC2D, ADLX65YLC2D, and ADLX65YDC2D.\n\nThis adapter is capable of delivering up to 65W of power, making it suitable for charging and powering laptops with high-performance specifications. It features a USB-', '{\"input\":\"100-240V AC, 50-60Hz, 1.5A\",\"output\":\"DC 20V 3.25A/2.25A 15V/9V/5V 3A, 65W\",\"connector type\":\"USB Type-c(USB-C)\"}', '[\"b2a4425fe98de810e3.png\",\"bec9d047b2b952e409.png\",\"af1074d361927f7063.png\"]', '[{\"name\":\"new\",\"price\":28000,\"newprice\":28000,\"promotion\":null}]', 'in stock', 0, '{}', 'active', '2024-01-14 12:18:56');

